          "title": "Overview of Our Project",
          "description": "<div>Today we will develop step-by-step an application that covers following functionalities:</div><ul><li>Sensor: first, we use a simultated sensor. And later a real sensor</li><li>Bluetooth: we will use Bluetooth to send battery level to a smartphone. Code will be created with AI-assisted development.</li><li>PMIC: configure device for voltage supply and use fuel gauge</li><li>Cellular: Get location information and send sensor data to cloud.</li></ul>",
