      ],
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Welcome to our first Nordic Tech Tour EMEA hands-on workshop!&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">This year, alongside our usual Nordic product updates, we're introducing a second day dedicated entirely to hands-on work. Together, we'll build a project using Nordic products including the nRF54L15, nRF93M1, and nPM1300.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We're looking forward to a productive and enjoyable session together — welcome aboard!</p>"
