        {
          "title": "Create a New Application",
          "description": "In the nRF Connect panel, click <strong>Create New Application</strong>.<div><br></div><div>An application in this context is just a folder containing your source code, build settings, and configuration files — everything Zephyr needs to compile firmware for your board.</div>",
          "codeBlocks": [],
          "images": [
